DECLARE Case HAS measure IS A STRING
DECLARE Person IS ONE OF Official
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF Take HAS who IS A Person, what IS A STRING

GIVEN c IS A Case
GIVETH A DEONTIC Person Action
rule c MEANS
    PARTY Official
    MAY Take Official m PROVIDED m EQUALS c's measure
    WITHIN 5
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH

#TRACE rule (Case "fine") AT 0 WITH
  PARTY Official DOES Take Official "fine" AT 2

#TRACE rule (Case "fine") AT 0 WITH
  PARTY Official DOES Take Official "other" AT 2
